SUMMARY:Showtunes Singalong Happy Hour with Zack Ford
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nTip Zack!\nCheck out his song list!\nMake a request!\n\nStart your evening right with theatre accompanist Zack Ford to belt out your favorite hits from Broadway\, Disney\, movie musicals\, and the great American songbook — live with a piano! This happy hour will feature showtunes karaoke and singalongs from all your favorite musicals. Then stick around and keep the evening going with Jill Paige for more beltin’ out Broadway!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/showtunes-singalong-happy-hour-with-zack-ford/2026-05-06/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
