CREATED:20250217T133424Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250217T133424Z
UID:10022468-1778101200-1778115600@sidgolds.com
SUMMARY:"Beltin' Out Broadway!" with Jill Paige
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nTip Jill!\nCheck out her song list!\nMake a request!\n\nIn the mood to sing your all-time favorite Broadway songs with a live accompanist?\n\nJoin Sid’s newest pianist\, Jill Parsons as she opens up her extensive musical theater songlist to you for hours of piano karaoke magic!\n\nAnd if you’re feeling more of the pop/rock/soul world for your performance\, Jill has you covered there as well! There’s something for everyone this Wednesday at Sid Gold’s DC!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-35-2-2/2026-05-06/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/JILL-PARSONS.jpg
